. 
. * A covariate that changes between waves: tvcov() takes one variable per
. * period. Period 1 uses delinq1, period 2 delinq2, period 3 delinq3.
. * The effects are then called with the stem 'delinq'.
. nwsaom, waves(klas12b_wave1 klas12b_wave2 klas12b_wave3 klas12b_wave4) outdegree reciprocity trans
> trip samex(sex) tvcov(delinq1 delinq2 delinq3) egox(delinq) altx(delinq) simx(delinq) seed(4) deta
> il

